  "live_records": {
    "q-34906": {
      "dom_id": "step-q34906",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Given $A=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 8 & 0 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,$ what is $\\text{dim}(\\text{Null}(A))?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find $\\text{dim}(\\text{Null}(A))$, we reduce $A$ to row echelon form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 8 & 0 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{4} & :={R}_{4}+(-\\frac{1}{2}){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe reduced matrix has $3$ pivot columns and $1$ non-pivot column (namely, the $4$th column). \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\text{dim}(\\text{Null}(A))=1.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
